    <h1>Plachieve<br />Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="legal-meta">Established: May 16, 2026 &nbsp;/&nbsp; Last Updated: May 16, 2026</p>

    <p>
      These Terms of Service (the "Terms") govern the conditions of use for Plachieve (the "App").
    </p>
    <p>
      By using the App, users (each a "User") agree to these Terms.
    </p>

    <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
    <p>
      The App is designed to help Users manage schedules, goals, and progress, receive notifications, display home screen widgets, and manage the Pro plan.
    </p>
    <p>
      The App is intended to assist Users in creating schedules, setting goals, and organizing their study and work plans.
    </p>
    <p>
      However, the App does not guarantee any specific outcome, including achievement of schedules or goals, improved grades, increased income, or improved quality of life.
    </p>

    <h2>2. App Features</h2>
    <p>The App provides the following main features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Management of schedules, task blocks, and fixed events</li>
      <li>Management of goals, checkpoints, and progress</li>
      <li>Management of daily templates and block templates</li>
      <li>Storage of completion records</li>
      <li>Local notification reminders</li>
      <li>Display of schedules on home screen widgets</li>
      <li>UI settings including themes and colors</li>
      <li>Creation and restoration of backup files</li>
      <li>Access to certain features or ad removal via the Pro plan</li>
      <li>Display of advertisements in the Free plan</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      The features of the App may be added, changed, or removed in future updates.
    </p>

    <h2>3. Conditions of Use</h2>
    <p>
      Users shall use the App in compliance with these Terms and all applicable laws and regulations.
    </p>
    <p>
      Minors must obtain consent from a parent or legal guardian before using the App, as required.
    </p>
    <p>
      Users are responsible for preparing, at their own expense, all devices, operating systems, network environments, Apple IDs, and App Store access required to use the App.
    </p>

    <h2>4. Account Registration</h2>
    <p>
      The App is a locally stored app that generally does not require account registration.
    </p>
    <p>
      Data entered by Users in the App, such as schedules, goals, profile settings, templates, and UI settings, is stored on the User's device.
    </p>
    <p>
      The developer does not collect schedules, goals, profile settings, templates, UI settings, or other content entered by Users in the App.
    </p>
    <p>
      However, for the purpose of displaying advertisements and processing payments, Google AdMob and Apple App Store / StoreKit may process information necessary to provide their respective services.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Data Stored on Device</h2>
    <p>The App may store the following information on the User's device:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Schedules, task blocks, fixed events, and completion records</li>
      <li>Goal titles, checkpoints, progress, and achievement notes</li>
      <li>Estimated sleep, meal, and break times, and lifestyle type</li>
      <li>Daily templates and block templates</li>
      <li>Themes, color settings, and display settings</li>
      <li>Active or inactive status of the Pro plan</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      This information is stored solely on the User's device and is not transmitted to the developer's servers.
    </p>
    <p>
      However, data stored on the device may be lost if the User loses their device, deletes the App, encounters OS issues, device failure, a device change, or for any other reason.
    </p>
    <p>
      Users are responsible for creating and managing backups at their own discretion.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Backup</h2>
    <p>
      The App may allow Users to manually create backup files.
    </p>
    <p>
      Backup files may contain in-app data such as schedules, goals, templates, and settings.
    </p>
    <p>
      Users are solely responsible for managing the storage location, sharing, and handling of backup files.
    </p>
    <p>
      The App may offer password-based encryption for backup files using AES-256-GCM.
    </p>
    <p>
      If a User shares a backup file with a third party, or if the storage location, device, or password are inadequately managed, a third party may be able to access the data.
    </p>
    <p>
      To the extent permitted by law, the developer is not responsible for the storage, sharing, loss, deletion, forgotten passwords, or failed restoration of backup files by Users.
    </p>
    <p>
      Backup files do not include the Pro plan purchase status. Pro plan restoration is handled based on Apple App Store / StoreKit purchase records.
    </p>

    <h2>7. Notifications</h2>
    <p>
      The App may send local notifications, such as reminders before the start of fixed events.
    </p>
    <p>
      Notifications are processed on the User's device and are not transmitted to the developer or any external server.
    </p>
    <p>
      The timing, availability, sound, and banner display of notifications may be affected by iOS settings, device status, Focus modes, notification permission settings, and OS behavior.
    </p>
    <p>
      The App does not guarantee that notifications will always be delivered at the exact scheduled time or that they will always be displayed.
    </p>
    <p>
      Users may change or disable notification settings through iOS Settings or within the App.
    </p>

    <h2>8. Home Screen Widgets</h2>
    <p>
      The App may display schedule information on home screen widgets.
    </p>
    <p>
      Data required for widget display is shared between the App and the widget via the App Group area on the device.
    </p>
    <p>
      This data is used only on the device and is not transmitted to the developer or any external server.
    </p>
    <p>
      The content, update frequency, and timing of widget display may be affected by iOS behavior, device status, battery level, and background refresh restrictions.
    </p>
    <p>
      The App does not guarantee that widget content will always update instantly or be displayed accurately at all times.
    </p>

