    </p>
    <p>
      Google AdMob may collect and process advertising IDs, device information, and usage data for purposes such as ad delivery, measurement of ad effectiveness, fraud prevention, and ad optimization.
    </p>
    <p>
      The content, frequency, format, and destination links of advertisements may be determined by third-party services such as Google AdMob.
    </p>
    <p>
