    </p>
    <p>
      If a User accesses a linked destination from an advertisement, the User does so subject to the terms, privacy policy, and other conditions of the provider of that destination.
    </p>
    <p>
      Users on the Pro plan will not see advertisements within the App. However, advertisements may temporarily not be hidden correctly due to OS issues, connectivity issues, delays in reflecting purchase status, or app bugs.
    </p>

    <h2>10. Pro Plan and In-App Purchases</h2>
    <p>
      The App may allow Users to purchase the Pro plan through Apple App Store / StoreKit.
    </p>
    <p>
      Purchasing the Pro plan may allow Users to remove ads and access other Pro features.
    </p>
    <p>
      The content, pricing, and terms of the Pro plan are as displayed within the App or on the App Store.
    </p>
    <p>
      Purchase processing, billing, refunds, purchase history, and payment method management are handled through Apple App Store and Apple ID.
    </p>
    <p>
      The developer does not collect credit card numbers, bank account information, or any other payment information from Users.
    </p>
    <p>
      Cancellations, refunds, and payment method changes after purchase are subject to Apple's terms and procedures.
    </p>
    <p>
      The App manages the Pro plan active/inactive status on-device based on Apple's billing processing results.
    </p>
    <p>
      Reflecting purchase status may take time depending on device status, Apple ID status, network conditions, App Store behavior, and OS issues.
    </p>
    <p>
      Users may restore the Pro plan purchase status using the App's restore purchase feature, if available.
    </p>
    <p>
